    "blurb": "Seamless database integration in Camunda",
    "overview": "Simplify data exchange with MySQL, MSSQL, MariaDB, and PostgreSQL databases. Seamlessly integrate database operations into your Camunda-based processes.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Seamless Data Exchange with Camunda and Databases",
    "splashDescription": "The SQL Connector for Camunda simplifies data exchange with MySQL, MSSQL, MariaDB, and PostgreSQL databases, allowing you to easily read and write data directly within your Camunda processes. This integration enables a wide range of process blueprints and use cases to be executed on Camunda without any additional installation or development. You can seamlessly integrate database operations into your Camunda-based processes, reducing complexity, enhancing security, and lowering maintenance costs. The Connector provides a robust and efficient method for data exchange directly within the Camunda platform.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/442271/overview/img1957829514017092770.png?7e5d886c3f589c5a3ff7e70a3eff5104",
